WEBVTT

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:10.210
At last, our heroes at GGG were able to defeat Pasdar...

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.440
...bringing peace to the entire planet.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.810
But as it turned out, that peace was just the calm before a raging storm.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.920
The enemy suddenly swooped down onto Earth...

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.620
...catching everyone off guard and driving GGG to destruction.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.790
GaoGaiGar finds himself at the mercy of the three attackers...

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.560
...only to be rescued by a colossal white robot.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:46.870
So overwhelmingly powerful it can easily crush the mightiest of foes...

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.680
Just who is this robot?

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.010
But that's...

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.550
Kaidou!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.240
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.140
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:12.850
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:17.760
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:23.990
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.080
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.780
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:36.740
It's time to launch!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.920
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.840
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.540
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.500
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.420
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:57.170
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.680
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:04.350
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:11.880
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:17.880
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.700
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.880
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:28.710
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:31.820
The 31 Machine Primevals Strike Back!

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.350
<i>The 31 Machine Primevals</i> <i>Strike Back!</i>

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:49.890
Templum, mundus, infini, tum, redire!

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.180
But that power, it's...

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:12.950
Who in the world are you?

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:35.610
Kaidou!

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.620
Soldatoo-J...

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:58.590
The highest-ranked warrior in the Trinary Solar System...

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.470
...has awakened.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.770
Presumed objective...

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.800
...the curse left by Abel!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.470
Pursue him!

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:20.760
Mamoru!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:25.860
Mamoru!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.020
Dad! Mom!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.430
My little Mamoru!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.440
Mamoru, you're not hurt, are you?

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:33.670
No.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.010
But...

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.140
Huh?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.980
For gosh sake...

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:49.060
Hey, Dad! Do something to save GaoGaiGar!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.330
GaoGaiGar? You mean that robot there?

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.290
It's that white battleship!

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:06.730
No, wait! It's another ship. And this one's even bigger!

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.670
But it's so gigantic, how can it possibly fly?

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.560
I've come to pick you up! Master Mamoru Amami!

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:38.740
Huh?

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.770
Hey! That's Swan's big brother!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.610
Mamoru, you mean you know that person?

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.580
Um, yeah!

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.850
It's a pleasure to meet you. You're Mamoru's parents, right?

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.560
My name is Stallion White.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.990
I'm with the United Nations Defense Organization.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:07.200
Uh, how does someone like you know my son?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.040
What is this thing, anyway?

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.280
You must forgive me, but...

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.370
...I am not at liberty to tell you at this time.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:28.650
But the thing is, we desperately need Mamoru's help!

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.120
I promise you that he'll be safe!

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:35.060
As soon as we're done, I promise we'll send him home to you.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:38.760
All right.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.000
Isamu!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:41.500
Honey...

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.900
Mamoru has a job to do.

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:47.400
And we shouldn't get in his way.

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.440
Dad...

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.010
You be careful, now, son.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:53.980
Okay!

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:56.240
My little Mamoru...

00:06:57.050 --> 00:07:00.280
Promise me... promise me you'll come home!

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:03.620
Okay. I'm going now, Mom.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.070
Sorry everything happened so suddenly, Mamoru.

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.110
That's okay.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.040
So anyway, how's Big Brother Gai?

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.220
Oh, right. He's going to be fine.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.420
He's undergoing the Fusion-Out process right now.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.850
One of this ship's duties is GaoGaiGar's maintenance, you see.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.090
There's nothing to worry about.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.350
Oh, that's good to know.

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.560
By the way, you saw it too, didn't you?

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:45.290
Yeah.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:47.230
Most likely, that was a Primeval!

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.030
Primeval?

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:51.930
Yes. That's what we call them.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.770
EI-01 from 2 years ago, as well as the three Primevals that you just saw...

00:07:56.840 --> 00:08:00.870
...arrived here through an ES Window that opened up near Earth.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.080
ES Window?

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:08.490
Right, it's a pathway to get here from far-off galaxies.

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:12.390
And it won't be long before an ES Window far bigger than...

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:14.950
...anything we've seen until now opens up.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:16.260
Does that mean...

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:20.500
The Zonderians you dealt with before were just the advance troops.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.460
This time around, it'll be the main forces coming!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:24.560
What?

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:28.270
This ship is being prepared to intercept the enemy.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.670
We're now heading for the U.N. fortress.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.010
Oh, is that where we're going?

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.740
This is the Intensive Care Unit. We have finished treating Cyborg Gai.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:39.110
I see. Thanks!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:43.420
Is it okay if I go see Big Brother Gai?

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:47.750
Big Brother Gai?

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:52.960
Is that you, Mamoru?

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.530
I'm so glad...

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.130
...that you're all right, Big Brother Gai.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:57.630
Yes...

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.200
But...

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:01.470
Everyone at GGG...

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:03.710
Big Brother Gai...

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:07.140
What good is it to be the world's most powerful cyborg?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:11.640
Is this steel body just so that I can survive without saving anyone?

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:15.190
What's the... what's the point of my living now?

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:22.190
Everything you've done till now had a purpose.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.460
So don't...

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.400
So don't say things like, "What's the point!"

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.970
I'm sorry, Mamoru.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:36.740
Big Brother Gai...

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:41.510
Lying here feeling sorry for myself... That's not what my job is, right?

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:46.510
Because I'm supposed to try to do my best for everybody else, right?

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:52.980
Gai! Mamoru!

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.450
We'll be arriving in satellite orbit soon.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.290
Would you mind coming to the Bridge?

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.190
Satellite orbit?

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.100
Huh? What's that?

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.940
We've just arrived. At our new headquarters.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:35.760
What you're seeing now was built by the United Nations to protect Earth.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.130
Orbit Base.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.930
Orbit Base?

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.070
Waha! It's awesome!

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:51.280
Huh?

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.750
That logo!

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:56.520
This is the GGG Orbit Base Main Order Room.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.760
Division IV, High-Mobility Twin-Hulled Supply...

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.420
...and Maintenance Ship, Amaterasu, do you copy?

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:01.650
This is Amaterasu.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.090
Now approaching via inert navigation.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.860
We'll handle the docking controls.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:10.060
Please switch over your flight controls after finishing the transformation.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:12.430
Mikoto! Is that you, Mikoto?

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:15.800
Welcome back, Gai, Mamoru!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:19.010
Starting today, this is our new base.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.280
Mikoto...

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:21.710
Waha!

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.850
Sorry we made you worry, Gai!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.660
Amaterasu, now preparing to dock.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:44.790
Open the trunk!

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.200
All balancer values stable.

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:48.970
Break and hold. Revised values, plus 0.37.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.600
Straight type set.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.440
Now starting the docking process.

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:59.580
Relative velocity differential. Connecting the Gun Tree Crane.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:06.420
Transferring gravity control.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.420
Docking complete. Unlocking doors.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:10.030
Okay! I, Stallion White, will now be escorting Gai Shishioh...

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:12.860
...and Mamoru Amami directly to the Main Order Room.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:15.300
Gai!

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:17.560
Mikoto...

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.200
I'm so glad you're safe, Gai!

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:23.140
Hey, hey, that's my line, actually.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:26.550
Sorry...

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.470
We've been waiting for you, Gai, Mamoru...

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.210
You're all here!

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:40.120
All right, now that we're all here, allow me to make an announcement.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:45.530
As of today, GGG, the Gutsy Geoid Guard, will disband!

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:46.690
Huh?

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:50.060
All former members will now be transferred to...

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.500
...the Global Defense Brigade of Heroes under the United Nations...

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.440
...the Gutsy Galaxy Guard!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.140
The new GGG!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.040
Any objections?

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.880
Oh, come on! Who do you think you're asking?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.990
Once again, let me welcome you to the new GGG.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:12.050
Captain of the Mobile Unit, Gai Shishioh.

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:14.560
And Special Agent Mamoru Amami.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.350
Gutsy Galaxy Guard?

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.490
Thanks a lot, guys! Keeping such an important secret from us!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.000
I know, I feel the same way!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:27.060
None of us knew about this either till after we escaped here!

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:31.680
We had no choice. It was a global defense secret, after all.

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:36.270
It took the arrival of those 3 Primevals to get...

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:40.580
...the U.N. - Global Defense Committee to give us their final approval.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.550
Primevals?

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.520
That's right.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:45.650
There was a warning in Galeon's message...

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:49.130
...regarding the threat of an intelligent alien life-form.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.920
The progenitors of the 31 Zonderians...

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:56.330
...we call them the 31 Machine Primevals.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:14:03.910
They stand above all at the top of the Zonderian pyramid, even EI-01.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.710
And you say they're headed for Earth?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.540
This Orbit Base of ours was built using all of mankind's resources...

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.610
...to combat the Primevals.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.250
Still, I'm so glad you all made it!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.550
Yes, that day...

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.420
When the Bay Tower was destroyed...

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.760
...we managed to disconnect just the Hexagon.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:28.560
That's how we were able to escape here using the Ul-Tech Engine.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:33.400
We've stowed ourselves inside the Orbit Base to regroup.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.440
We're not quite running at capacity yet...

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:37.910
...but we are ready to go into Intercept Attack phase.

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:43.210
Us Americans managed to escape here ahead of everyone else...

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.810
...so we sent Stallion down to pick you two up.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:53.760
And now at last, Dr. Liger and I can count ourselves as members of GGG!

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.150
Hey! Is it true that Mamoru's here?

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:58.660
Mic!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.590
Hey, 13! Don't forget you're on standby for combat!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:06.100
Oh! But being on standby is so boring, you know!

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:10.500
Hey, Mamoru! As soon as this is over, we're gonna play, right?

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:11.810
Yeah!

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.740
Chief, so what's the game plan?

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:16.610
Right, I'll explain.

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:20.750
The Primevals will arrive here on Earth through an ES Window...

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:22.650
...along the satellite orbit.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.520
When this window opens, it causes a powerful gravitational field aberration.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.150
There were two different patterns of this that occurred before.

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:33.930
This time, we finally managed to gauge the warning signs in advance.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:39.360
They were always a step ahead of us, but not this time!

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:42.570
And so, when the ES Window opens up...

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:47.170
...we'll simultaneously attack with all 13 models of the Mic Sounders line!

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:50.710
They are our very last line of defense now.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.640
Huh? Then what about that white robot?

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:56.450
Yes, the battleship robot.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.820
We don't know anything about it, either.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.320
It doesn't appear to be an enemy, but...

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:05.620
I tried tracking it, but it managed to evade all of my systems.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.900
It's completely discouraging.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:13.470
At any rate, it won't do to count an unknown entity as an ally in this battle.

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.300
So what's the timetable for this operation?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.900
According to my estimates, we have a little over 735 minutes before...

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.070
...the ES Window opens completely.

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:21.740
Good.

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:23.240
Oh, no!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:27.680
The ES Window's gravitational field deflection factor is surging!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:28.880
What did you say?

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.860
Uh-oh! The enemy's quicker than we thought.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:38.690
No need to panic! We're already prepared to counterattack the enemy!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:39.960
Right!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:44.630
From here on, all GGG members are ordered to go into Level 1 Battle Mode!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.810
Stallion, how're GaoGaiGar's repairs?

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.280
It's no good, you won't be taking him into battle anytime soon.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:57.450
Damn! So there's nothing I can do but sit here and watch?

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.990
All members of the Mic Sounders Brigade...

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.220
...prepare for launch from the Linear Catapult!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.800
The 13th, launch!

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:18.060
Next, the 12th!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:24.800
Oh! Mic's gonna fight in GaoGaiGar's place, right?

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:26.250
The 2nd!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:29.850
The 1st!

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.580
The entire Mic Sounders Brigade has been launched!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:41.450
Okay! System Change!

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.260
Mic Sounders!

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:56.570
All units, get into formation!

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.880
The deflection rate of the ES Window is 100%!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.280
The enemy is about to appear.

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.250
They're in that form again?

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.260
Most likely, that's the form they take for interplanetary flight.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:21.030
If we're going to destroy them, we've got to do it now!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.590
All right! Disc X, load!

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:26.200
Disc X, set on!

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:31.200
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.810
Acoustic Field Oscillator, maximum output feedback start!

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:41.220
Space orientation, energy induction, soliton generation!

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.390
Solitary Wave Riser, launch!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.170
Disintegration of the first batch of enemy troops confirmed.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:09.040
Solitary Wave Form attack by oscillating energy solitons.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:12.980
Operational efficiency, extremely low-level.

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.910
Absolute Danger Rate, 32%.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:20.180
What?

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:23.520
What's going on?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.000
What's that?

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.540
It's the one that survived the other day!

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.430
Mic the 1st, the 3rd, and the 7th destroyed!

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:37.070
Don't we have any robots that can go out and help?

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:41.440
At this rate, the entire Mic Brigade will be wiped out!

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:44.620
What's this?

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:48.490
An unidentified object of huge proportions is swiftly approaching.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:49.780
Take a look on the Main Screen.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.590
It's the white battleship!

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:05.830
What? What just happened?

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:07.830
Everybody, stay focused!

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:11.700
Everyone left keep blasting away with the Solitary Waves!

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:14.510
Or else we'll never destroy the 31 Primevals!

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:15.910
Roger!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.250
Is that it?

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.170
J-Quath!

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:52.810
I won't let you escape this time!

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.610
J-Bird! Plug Out!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.760
J-Der!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.030
He separated!

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:11.530
Plasma Wing!

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:18.870
Plasma Sword!

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:43.830
Come on, guys!

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:44.900
We're almost there!

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:00.720
Oh, great!

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:02.780
Disintegration of the enemy confirmed.

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:04.450
We did it!

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:06.390
Thank goodness!

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:08.290
Mission accomplished!

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:10.720
A victory for mankind!

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:20.070
Looks like we were in time somehow.

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:24.780
What's that?

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:25.640
It's the cores!

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:27.340
The enemy cores have survived!

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:33.580
28 more to go.

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:40.350
As it turned out, this was just the prelude to a new battle.

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:50.570
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:55.440
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:01.620
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:06.410
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:10.580
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:17.510
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.570 --> 00:23:24.270
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:28.930
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:34.270
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:41.270
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:47.700
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:50.930
Mamoru is now on board the ultimate battleship, the J-Ark...

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:54.840
...and seeing its far superior technology, is completely overwhelmed.

00:23:55.440 --> 00:23:58.310
Now Kaidou has predicted the resurrection of the 31 Primevals.

00:23:58.380 --> 00:24:00.710
A hot-blooded battle to decide mankind's fate...

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:02.940
...begins in the Arctic Ocean!

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:05.140
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.350 --> 00:24:07.250
"Journey to Absolute Zero"

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:06.240
Journey to Absolute Zero

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:10.050
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:14.740
J-Ark's ES Missile

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:14.490
This is the Key to Victory!
